<title>SRI LANKA: CTC Eagle announces bonus issue.</title>
<headline>CTC Eagle announces bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>CTC Eagle Insurance Company Ltd announced a bonus issue of one new share for every 15 held, the stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company's issued capital would increase to 20 million shares from 18.75 million, brokers said.</p>
<p>CTC Eagle Insurance Company is a subsidiary of Ceylon Tobacco Co Ltd, which is a unit of BAT Industries Plc.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
